[6657]="700320F4\n1\tSpeak to Hwitmon and convince him of his daughter's good fortune\tHwitmon can be found at his home within Cliving. Hwitmon awaits news of your venture to Randgar's farm with his daughter, Inhild. You have decided to uphold Inhild's wish that her father be told what would make him most pleased.\n",
[6658]="7000E5C0\n1\tSpeak with the Inn League Member in The Bird and Baby Inn\tThe Bird and Baby Inn is across the road, west of Town Hole. Go to the Bird and Baby in Michel Delving and talk to the Inn League member there.\n2\tUse Gunderic's Ale\030Use Fern Beer\030Use Perry's Porter\030Use Rootknot's Cider\tDrink six beers within the allotted amount of time.\n3\tUse Gunderic's Ale\030Use Fern Beer\030Use Perry's Porter\030Use Rootknot's Cider\tDrink five more beers within the allotted amount of time.\n4\tUse Gunderic's Ale\030Use Fern Beer\030Use Perry's Porter\030Use Rootknot's Cider\tDrink four more beers within the allotted amount of time.\n5\tUse Gunderic's Ale\030Use Fern Beer\030Use Perry's Porter\030Use Rootknot's Cider\tDrink three more beers within the allotted amount of time.\n6\tUse Gunderic's Ale\030Use Fern Beer\030Use Perry's Porter\030Use Rootknot's Cider\tDrink two more beers within the allotted amount of time.\n7\tUse Gunderic's Ale\030Use Fern Beer\030Use Perry's Porter\030Use Rootknot's Cider\tDrink one more beer within the allotted amount of time.\n8\tTalk to Ioco Underhill\tFull and queasy with drink, you should speak with the Inn League member in front of you.\n",
